    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>Last updated: February 2026</p>

    <p>Dubbie ("we", "our", or "us") operates the Dubbie Lite mobile application (the "Service"). This page informs you of our policies regarding the collection, use, and disclosure of personal data when you use our Service and the choices you have associated with that data.</p>

    <h2>1. Information Collection and Use</h2>
    <p>We do not collect or store any personally identifiable information. The Service processes audio files locally on your device or temporarily on our cloud servers (if Cloud Mode is selected) strictly for the purpose of audio separation.</p>

    <h2>2. Audio Processing (Cloud Mode)</h2>
    <p>If you choose to use the Cloud Processing features (Light or Pro):</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Your audio file is temporarily uploaded to our secure servers.</li>
        <li>The file is processed by our AI algorithms (such as Demucs) to separate the vocals and instruments.</li>
        <li>Once the processed files are returned to your device, both the original and processed files are <strong>immediately deleted</strong> from our servers.</li>
        <li>We do not store, keep, share, or listen to any audio files you upload.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. Local Processing</h2>
    <p>If you use the Local Mode, all processing occurs directly on your device. No audio data leaves your phone.</p>

    <h2>4. Advertising and Analytics</h2>
    <p>Our application uses <strong>Google AdMob</strong> to serve advertisements and <strong>Google Analytics for Firebase</strong> to understand how users interact with our app. These services may collect and use identifying technologies (like Advertising IDs, IP addresses, and usage data) to serve personalized ads and provide usage statistics.</p>
    <p><strong>For users in the European Economic Area (EEA) and the UK:</strong> We use Google's User Messaging Platform (UMP) to request your explicit consent for personalized advertising and data analytics before any data is collected. You can manage or revoke your consent choices at any time through the privacy settings within the app or your device settings.</p>

    <h2>5. Subscriptions and Payments</h2>
    <p>All subscription and payment processing is handled securely by the Google Play Store. We do not have access to your credit card information or billing details.</p>

    <h2>6. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
    <p>We may update our Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of any changes by posting the new Privacy Policy on this page.</p>

    <h2>7. Contact Us</h2>
    <p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact the developer via the Google Play Store contact information.</p>
